# DigitalCoach — sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension).
# Start the service first:  uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8080

@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Analyze an uploaded video (multipart). Put a real clip next to this file.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----digitalcoach

------digitalcoach
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="exercise"

Push-up
------digitalcoach
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="pushup.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./pushup.mp4
------digitalcoach--

### Analyze by Supabase Storage reference (JSON) — available after milestone M8
POST {{base}}/api/v1/analyze/by-reference
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exercise": "Push-up",
  "video": { "bucket": "workout-videos", "path": "user-123/pushup.mp4" }
}
